      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "网上中文课太多了，我不知道怎么选。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你先想清楚自己最需要什么。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我想提高听力和日常口语。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那就别选只讲语法的课。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我看到一个课程，每课有十分钟视频。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "有没有听力练习？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "有，还有短对话和跟读。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那听起来比较适合你。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "不过课程很长，有一百多课。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "不用一次想完。先学前五课看看。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "如果不适合就换，对吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，不要因为已经开始就一定要学完。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我以前常常买了课就觉得必须全部完成。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "真正有用比“全部完成”更重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我先看有没有免费试听。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "很好，先体验再决定。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样就不会因为选择太多而浪费时间。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc028_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，目标清楚，选择就简单多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
